<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="hero-copy"><view class="eyebrow">MADE FOR THE TWO OF US</view><view class="title">我们的小饭桌</view><view class="subtitle">一个点菜，一个下厨。<view>把每顿饭，慢慢做成喜欢的样子。</view></view></view><image src="/assets/kitchen.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="notice">{{demo?'本机演示 · 同一设备模拟两种角色，不会同步到家属微信':'微信云端模式 · 家庭数据不公开'}}</view><view wx:if="{{!bound}}" class="card"><text class="label">怎么称呼你</text><input value="{{name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="field" maxlength="30" /><button class="primary" bindtap="create" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">我是大厨，创建小饭桌</button><text class="label">家人给你的邀请码</text><input value="{{code}}" data-key="code" bindinput="field" maxlength="64" /><button class="secondary" bindtap="join" disabled="{{busy}}">我是点菜的人，加入小饭桌</button></view><button wx:if="{{!demo}}" class="secondary" bindtap="demo">先试试本机演示</button><block wx:if="{{demo}}"><view class="card"><view class="heading">当前扮演：{{role==='cook'?'做饭的人':'点菜的人'}}</view><view class="row"><button class="secondary grow" bindtap="guest">切到点菜者</button><button class="secondary grow" bindtap="cook">切到大厨</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="cloud">切回微信云端</button></view></block><block wx:if="{{bound}}"><view wx:if="{{inviteCode}}" class="card"><view class="heading">邀请家人来点菜</view><view class="muted">邀请码仅发给家人，不要公开。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="copy">复制邀请码</button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">我的饭量</view><view class="muted">1 = 菜谱基准一人份。范围0.25～3，可按经验调整。</view><text class="label">食量系数</text><input type="digit" value="{{appetite}}" data-key="appetite" bindinput="field" /><button class="secondary" bindtap="appetite" disabled="{{busy}}">保存我的饭量</button></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{role==='cook'}}"><view class="row between"><text class="heading">大厨的菜谱</text><button class="small" bindtap="recipe">新增</button></view><view wx:for="{{state.recipes}}" wx:key="id" class="divider"><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="recipe">{{item.name}} · 编辑配方 / 图片</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="subscribe" disabled="{{busy}}">订阅下次菜单提醒</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="history">过去的小饭桌</button></block><view class="footer">这里只保存家庭菜单、配方和采购记录。不读取通讯录、定位或健康信息。真实使用需接入你的小程序账号与云环境。</view></view>